    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to present this superb fifth-floor, one-bedroom corner apartment, offering stylish, modern living in one of Dublin's most sought-after locations. Extending to approximately 549 sq ft (51 sq m), this beautifully maintained home has been thoughtfully designed to maximise both comfort and practicality, making it an ideal city residence or investment opportunity.\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a spacious entrance hallway featuring attractive laminate wood flooring and excellent built-in storage, including a convenient hot press. The hallway leads to a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, which flows seamlessly into a well-appointed kitchen fitted with a range of modern units.\r\nFlooded with natural light, the living and dining room enjoys laminate wood flooring and direct access to a private decked balcony, where you can take in elevated views across Dublin.\r\nThe generously proportioned double bedroom also benefits from laminate wood flooring, built-in wardrobes, and its own access to the balcony, creating a bright and airy retreat. Completing the accommodation is a well-presented bathroom featuring a full-size bath with shower attachment.\r\nExternally, the property boasts a private decked balcony, ideal for relaxing or entertaining while enjoying the city views. Residents also benefit from a secure designated parking space and access to a beautifully landscaped central courtyard.\r\nThe location is second to none, with Dublin city centre within easy reach and excellent transport links provided by the Luas and numerous bus routes. A wealth of local amenities are nearby, along with key employers and institutions, including the Digital Hub, St. James's Hospital, The Coombe Women's Hospital, and several third-level colleges. Having undergone significant regeneration in recent years, the area has become one of Dublin's most vibrant and desirable places to live.\r\nCombining contemporary finishes, a practical layout, and an exceptional location, this impressive fifth-floor corner apartment presents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a stylish city home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway\t\t3.8m * 1.07m + 2.88m * 1.03m\r\nLaminate wood floor. Large storage cupboard.\r\n\r\nLiving room\t4.5m * 3.21m\r\nLaminate wood floor. Wall mounted lighting. Intercom to front door. Door to balcony.\r\n\r\nKitchen\t\t2.4m * 2.4m\r\nLaminate wood floor. Fully fitted floor and wall units. Stainless steel sink unit. Tiled splashback. Electric oven, hob and extractor fan. Plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t5.34m * 3.01m\r\nLaminate wood floor. Built in wardrobes. Phone point. Door to balcony. \r\n\r\nBathroom\t2.42m * 1.89m\r\nBath with shower attach. Tiled surround. WC. Pedestal Wash hand basin. Wall mounted heater. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBalcony\t\t1.71m * 3.13m\r\nDecked."
      },
